{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"c":1,"y":0.10029069751593778,"w":0.21810699462890626,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.1296296300594228,"h":0.016022611984234936},{"y":0.14124062199815757,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2","x":0.12728890650037045,"h":0.025732152734403768,"c":1,"w":0.34018061319986981},{"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score.","x":0.12757202639381263,"y":0.18021201411841892,"w":0.65637858072916666,"h":0.016008916255020877},{"w":0.74897120157877617,"x":0.12757201227586762,"h":0.018895348053517669,"t":"Advertisement has always been a crucial part in the world of marketing. Throughout the decade,","y":0.2049418608542628,"c":1},{"y":0.22254623692626885,"h":0.020727333949508098,"c":1,"x":0.12748465587777522,"w":0.7388631184895833,"t":"we have seen a significant increase in the amount of advertisements, whether it is on the media"},{"w":0.76954732259114589,"c":1,"t":"like television or widespread through social network platforms. The goal of advertisements is to get","h":0.018989507947007489,"x":0.125514409177678,"y":0.2426383984016991},{"x":0.12757200664198989,"w":0.78600824991861984,"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1,"t":"consumers to buy a targeted product, and while this method has been proven considerably successful","y":0.2629564194839844},{"h":0.0195034305675853,"x":0.12749120819487,"y":0.28155419400451009,"w":0.70795013427734366,"c":1,"t":"generally, some people view it as too prevalent to catch the consumers attention any more."},{"t":"Advertisements can act as a strong persuasion device to seemingly hypnotize people into buying","y":0.30800942331483117,"w":0.75514404296874993,"x":0.12757201143554217,"h":0.019140164899882128,"c":1},{"t":"goods and services. This is so because of the tactics placed in the messages, such as showing","h":0.01896040459263304,"c":1,"y":0.32703488410782966,"x":0.12757200594540885,"w":0.73456792195638021},{"h":0.018929588219021465,"t":"people having a good time together when using a particular product, using bandwagen, showing only","y":0.3473837213194757,"x":0.12757200662873666,"w":0.78600824991861973,"c":1},{"x":0.12757200757362938,"t":"the upsides of usage, and applying compare and contrast strategies to show the effects of using the","h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1,"w":0.77983540852864575,"y":0.36627907015650074},{"x":0.1275720166753869,"h":0.018910756240323567,"y":0.38515901080657311,"w":0.77572016398111987,"t":"product and make it stand out. Even if people do not know it, these messages are repeated several","c":1},{"w":0.75720163981119792,"c":1,"y":0.40400471128720983,"x":0.1255144065074025,"h":0.018960404592633151,"t":"times and soon it may brainwash people to Finally go out and get the product. For instance, if a"},{"x":0.12749508752768662,"w":0.77792587280273451,"h":0.020769090057121353,"c":1,"t":"person is watching television and sees a certain advertisement of a snack many times, the repeated","y":0.42289933270052971},{"c":1,"x":0.12757200506115945,"y":0.443168433735601,"t":"sight of the scrumptious food may result in that person feeling hungry and succumbing to the","w":0.74074076334635408,"h":0.019140164899882128},{"t":"advertisement at last.","h":0.01870925462990114,"y":0.46108717487074047,"x":0.12520723379399068,"c":1,"w":0.17575178782145184},{"c":1,"h":0.020169939955496763,"t":"Nevertheless, there is another point of view in which the widespread of advertisements makes","x":0.12749688769274617,"y":0.48783011935040621,"w":0.73471084594726566},{"x":0.12749769492051344,"c":1,"t":"it a normal thing. After watching a dozen of advertisements people will see it as a mere every","w":0.73677927652994801,"y":0.50732992921583953,"h":0.021059759654482035},{"y":0.52761627945880141,"h":0.018909044344377457,"t":"day routine and cease to pay attention to the message of the advertisement. Some people may","c":1,"x":0.12757200504848168,"w":0.74074076334635419},{"t":"even choose to turn off a television channel, for instance, only just to avoid seeing and hearing","x":0.12757201324294917,"y":0.5465116282950585,"c":1,"h":0.018895348053517669,"w":0.74279836018880208},{"t":"repetetive advertisements. After a certain frequency, they start to get bored and stop paying","y":0.56412464716113564,"w":0.72451049804687506,"h":0.022851357611666234,"x":0.12746241037098721,"c":1},{"w":0.73480916341145841,"x":0.1274477597509166,"t":"attention to ads. Hence, in the end, the main goal of advertisements is not complete since the","y":0.58265608076864717,"h":0.022909537361423538,"c":1},{"y":0.60453474639058602,"w":0.77572016398111987,"h":0.019140164899882239,"c":1,"t":"people whom the messages are sent out to do not receive that message. A real life example can be","x":0.12757201675139943},{"w":0.77572016398111976,"x":0.12757201667465229,"y":0.62499999984075572,"c":1,"t":"seen from advertisements in a particular social media plattorm, Youtube. In the Youtube marketing","h":0.017520612485276699},{"w":0.77376342773437512,"h":0.020238650561221538,"c":1,"t":"mechanism, advertisements are place before and in between videos, hoping that the viewers would","x":0.12546359414580696,"y":0.64241442113363523},{"x":0.12757201032953447,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1,"w":0.76131688435872391,"t":"also be forced to watch the advertisements, too. However, this is not usually the case, since many","y":0.6627906975134672},{"x":0.12718894579073417,"y":0.67748496323894025,"h":0.024496642383445177,"w":0.39976206461588548,"c":1,"t":"people would just click \"Skip Ad\" and continue on."},{"h":0.01889534805351778,"t":"In conclusion, advertisements can be successful in persuading people to purchase goods and","x":0.15637860768860776,"w":0.73251027425130211,"y":0.70784883759689254,"c":1},{"y":0.72819767425872928,"t":"services, or they can be unsuccessful in many ways. They are very commonly seen nowadays, but","x":0.1275720195243385,"w":0.75720163981119792,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1},{"x":0.12757201856353967,"w":0.7633744812011718,"h":0.018933012010913575,"c":1,"t":"not all of them fulfill their purpose. Thus, advertisements must be designed and presented in the","y":0.74705535968741821},{"c":1,"h":0.022318069449021483,"w":0.3872423044840495,"t":"correct way to result in the highest effectiveness.","y":0.76503519245392282,"x":0.12733774514974519},{"t":"134","c":1,"x":0.12757201706445012,"y":0.91860465100435762,"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.013081395583944722}]}